{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ちはるとみなみに挟まれた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/1897746/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/1897746/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんまりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/1897746/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から3連休！\n月曜日は握手会ですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/1897746/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"marble SUDってブランドを\n知ってるかい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/1897746/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知ってる♪服持ってる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/1897746/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京事変聴くんだ！\nちなみに好きな曲は何ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/1897746/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今夜はから騒ぎ\nいちばん聴いてるかも！\n同じく全曲すきなので選べません><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/1897746/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーとプライベートで\n遊ぶときもお互いをあだ名で\n呼び合ってるの？\nそれともプライベート用の\n呼び方があるメンバーも\nいるんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/1897746/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほとんどあだ名で呼んでないわー\nせいら3人はあだ名で呼んでる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/1897746/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Wまい、Wさゆり、Wひなもあだ名！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーは私のことまりかって\n呼ぶよ^^\nあ、まあやはまりかちゃんて\n呼んでる時がある"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/1897746/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/1897746/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"横浜の握手会の服決まってる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/1897746/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決まってないねん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/1897746/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーしよかな\n**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日ドラッグストアで\n顔パックいっぱい買ってきました笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お肌ピチピチ^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/1897746/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんにマッサージ\nしてあげました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/1897746/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほめて笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではおやすみなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}